<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Erreur serveur — Planify Pro</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root { --green-800:#2C5F2E; --cream:#FAF8F5; --text-500:#6b6b6b; }
    * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
    body {
      font-family:'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background:var(--cream);
      min-height:100vh;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      text-align:center;
      padding:24px;
    }
    .error-code {
      font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size:8rem;
      font-weight:700;
      color:var(--green-800);
      opacity:0.15;
      line-height:1;
      margin-bottom:-20px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size:2rem;
      color:#1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    p { color:var(--text-500); margin-bottom:32px; line-height:1.7; }
    .btn {
      display:inline-block;
      background:var(--green-800);
      color:white;
      padding:12px 28px;
      border-radius:10px;
      text-decoration:none;
      font-weight:500;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <div class="error-code">500</div>
    <h1>Erreur inattendue</h1>
    <p>Une erreur s'est produite de notre côté.<br>Réessayez dans quelques instants.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">← Retour à l'accueil</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
